# Empty = same-origin relative requests (e.g. /api/core/Auth/Token), proxied
# to the real backend by vite.config.ts's server.proxy. This sidesteps the
# backend's missing CORS policy for local dev — see README's
# "Backend integration" section. Once CORS is fixed backend-side (or for a
# production build, where the dev proxy doesn't apply), set this to the real
# absolute URL instead, e.g. https://localhost:44318
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://localhost:44318
